---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy - A Due Passi Da"
  description="Privacy policy for B&B A Due Passi Da, Corato (BA)."
>
  <div class="privacy-page">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px; padding: 60px 32px;">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> 2025</p>

      <h2>1. Data Controller</h2>
      <p>The data controller for personal data is the manager of the B&B "A Due Passi Da", located at Via Duomo, 81 – 70033 Corato (BA).</p>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:antoniomodugno01@gmail.com">antoniomodugno01@gmail.com</a></p>

      <h2>2. Types of Data Collected</h2>
      <p>The website collects the following personal data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> name, surname, email, phone number (optional)</li>
        <li><strong>Booking data:</strong> arrival and departure dates, number of guests, request type, special requests</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> technical cookies necessary for website functioning (localStorage for cookie consent)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. Purpose of Processing</h2>
      <p>Data collected through the quote request form is processed for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Respond to quote requests</li>
        <li>Manage property bookings</li>
        <li>Communicate with the client to organize the stay</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
      <p>Data processing is based on the explicit consent provided by the user when submitting the form (art. 6, par. 1, lett. a of GDPR).</p>

      <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Personal data is retained for the time necessary to manage quote requests and any bookings. In case of no booking, data is deleted within 12 months of collection.</p>

      <h2>6. Third-Party Communication</h2>
      <p>Data collected through the form is sent and managed via the <strong>Netlify Forms</strong> service (https://www.netlify.com), a GDPR-compliant external provider. No other communications to third parties are made, except as required by law.</p>

      <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
      <p>The website uses exclusively <strong>technical cookies</strong> necessary for the functioning of the consent banner (localStorage). No profiling or tracking cookies are used.</p>

      <h2>8. Data Subject Rights</h2>
      <p>The user has the right at any time to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access their personal data</li>
        <li>Rectify inaccurate or incomplete data</li>
        <li>Request data deletion</li>
        <li>Object to processing</li>
        <li>Request limitation of processing</li>
        <li>Request data portability</li>
      </ul>
      <p>To exercise your rights, contact: <a href="mailto:antoniomodugno01@gmail.com">antoniomodugno01@gmail.com</a></p>

      <h2>9. Changes to Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically. The last update date is indicated at the top of the page.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 40px;"><a href="/en/" class="btn btn-primary">← Back to website</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
